WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
welcome to the new Chase Sapphire Lounge&nbsp;
at Boston Logan International Airport the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.340
lounge is the first of its type in the United&nbsp;
States upon entering the lounge you'll have to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.120
present your Chase Sapphire Reserve card and&nbsp;
its accompanying priority pass membership card&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:17.400
the lounge is a large dining area with self-serve&nbsp;
and made-to-order food options you can order food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.720
right to your table by scanning a QR code&nbsp;
walking toward the back of the lounge you'll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.820
find a bar and Tap Room the bar reserves wine&nbsp;
beer traditional and signature cocktails the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.240
booths at the back of the lounge are particularly&nbsp;
useful for working at the lounge since they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.080
outfitted with power outlets and provide a bit of&nbsp;
privacy if you need to take a zoom or a phone call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.160
there's also a wellness room with five private&nbsp;
stations so you can enjoy a massage away from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:42.540
the hustle and bustle of the Airport Boston is&nbsp;
the first of many airports to get a sapphire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:46.500
Lounge you'll find one other Sapphire Lounge in&nbsp;
Hong Kong International Airport and others are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.340
soon to open around the US it's an Ultra Modern&nbsp;
take on the airport lounge and its amenities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:54.840
make it a great place to relax or get work done&nbsp;
before your next trip other airports slated to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:58.860
get a sapphire Lounge include New York LaGuardia&nbsp;
Philadelphia and San Diego International Airport

